    "voice": "produce_events/202800802/2028008020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "店員",
    "text": "そうなんだ。なんにも変わらなくて退屈じゃない？\r\n──あ、いつもの自家製レモネードでいいかな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2028008020040,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "わぁっ……！\r\nはい！　それで……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202800802/2028008020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "店員",
    "text": "…………何か、スケッチでもしに行くの？",
